# three kits sound at once (engine.c NDL, the RAM): a fourth, however picked (here SEL's list), says "T4 SILENT 3 kits
# at most" and its picture "silent: 3 kits at most"; it sounds once another kit changes engine (dl_rehome), and a
# kit preset on a synth track then is the fourth again. T1 is a kit to start with
wait 300
listen
param 2 0 8
param 3 0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 0
spin ALGO 3
expect trk 4
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 6 30
tap SEL
expect par4.0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 8
said T4 SILENT
wait 2200
shot kit4_silent.png
# T2 a synth again: its unit goes to T4
param 2 0 0
wait 20
expect kitsilent 0
unsaid SILENT
param 2 0 8
wait 20
expect kitsilent 2
said T2 SILENT
